{"verse_key": "72:23", "surah": 72, "verse": 23, "text_uthmani": "إِلَّا بَلَـٰغًا مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ وَرِسَـٰلَـٰتِهِۦ ۚ وَمَن يَعْصِ ٱللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُۥ فَإِنَّ لَهُۥ نَارَ جَهَنَّمَ خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَآ أَبَدًا", "translation": "But [I have for you] only notification from Allāh, and His messages.\" And whoever disobeys Allāh and His Messenger - then indeed, for him is the fire of Hell; they will abide therein forever.", "verse_from_ms": 254190, "verse_to_ms": 272820, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/72.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "إِلَّا", "start_ms": 254190, "end_ms": 255160}, {"i": 1, "text": "بَلَـٰغًا", "start_ms": 255160, "end_ms": 256080}, {"i": 2, "text": "مِّنَ", "start_ms": 256080, "end_ms": 256980}, {"i": 3, "text": "ٱللَّهِ", "start_ms": 256980, "end_ms": 257790}, {"i": 4, "text": "وَرِسَـٰلَـٰتِهِۦ", "start_ms": 257790, "end_ms": 260070}, {"i": 5, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 260070, "end_ms": 260560}, {"i": 6, "text": "وَمَن", "start_ms": 260560, "end_ms": 262470}, {"i": 7, "text": "يَعْصِ", "start_ms": 262470, "end_ms": 263900}, {"i": 8, "text": "ٱللَّهَ", "start_ms": 263900, "end_ms": 265120}, {"i": 9, "text": "وَرَسُولَهُۥ", "start_ms": 265120, "end_ms": 265710}, {"i": 10, "text": "فَإِنَّ", "start_ms": 265710, "end_ms": 266330}, {"i": 11, "text": "لَهُۥ", "start_ms": 266330, "end_ms": 267680}, {"i": 12, "text": "نَارَ", "start_ms": 267680, "end_ms": 269010}, {"i": 13, "text": "جَهَنَّمَ", "start_ms": 269010, "end_ms": 271140}, {"i": 14, "text": "خَـٰلِدِينَ", "start_ms": 271140, "end_ms": 272735}, {"i": 15, "text": "فِيهَآ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 16, "text": "أَبَدًا", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}